# Generated at runtime — NEVER commit.
#
# ── data/ ───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# ./data/registry/certs/ca.key is the private key of the CA that every vcluster
# node is told to trust. The source regenerates it on every `make run`, so a
# committed copy is worthless AND dangerous: it would let anyone holding the
# repo mint certificates your cluster accepts.
#
# data/registry/docker is copied from the source's registry storage in order to
# reproduce a real image pull. ~245 MB of image blobs.
data/


old/